flowchart TD
    A[Teacher actions or rated essays available] --> B{Which retraining path?}

    A_DESC[Start: Teacher ratings or teacher sample updates trigger retraining flow]
    A -.plain language.-> A_DESC

    B -->|Proficiency model| C[POST /train/retrain<br/>FastAPI]
    C --> D[_get_training_rows from Supabase<br/>supabase-py]
    D --> E[_extract_training_matrix<br/>NumPy + custom feature extraction]
    E --> F{At least 5 rated essays?}
    F -->|No| G[Return status: skipped]
    F -->|Yes| H{Language is English?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Load ASAP2 CSV and blend with PH essays weighted 2x<br/>pandas or CSV loader + NumPy]
    H -->|No| J[Use PH essays only]
    I --> K[RobustScaler fit_transform<br/>scikit-learn]
    J --> K
    K --> L[Train SVC RBF C=10 gamma=scale class_weight=balanced<br/>scikit-learn SVC]
    L --> M[Save model: proficiency_model_en.pkl or proficiency_model_tl.pkl<br/>pickle]
    M --> N[Hot-reload in-memory model]
    N --> O[Update retrain_status.json last_retrain and rated_at_retrain<br/>JSON]

    B -->|Complexity model| P[POST /training/add-sample<br/>FastAPI]
    P --> Q[Validate level and text length<br/>Pydantic + Python checks]
    Q --> R[Extract features and append to teacher_samples.jsonl<br/>NumPy + JSONL]
    R --> S[Call retrain_complexity_model in background thread<br/>asyncio.to_thread + threading]
    S --> T{Retrain lock available?}
    T -->|No| U[Return sample_saved; apply next retrain]
    T -->|Yes| V[Load CommonLit features plus teacher samples<br/>CSV pipeline + JSONL reader]
    V --> W{Any training data?}
    W -->|No| X[RuntimeError: no training data]
    W -->|Yes| Y[Train TextComplexitySVM<br/>scikit-learn + custom wrapper]
    Y --> Z[Save complexity_model.pkl and swap global in-memory model<br/>pickle + in-process reload]
    Z --> AA[Return status ok]

    subgraph SIMPLE_GUIDE[Easy Guide]
        G1[Proficiency retrain: updates essay rating model using teacher-rated essays]
        G2[Complexity retrain: updates reading-level model using verified training samples]
        G3[If not enough data, system skips safely and waits for more samples]
        G4[After retrain, new model file is saved and loaded immediately]
    end

    O -.result.-> G4
    AA -.result.-> G4
    G -.skip reason.-> G3
    X -.skip reason.-> G3

    classDef guide fill:#eef7ff,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:1px,color:#0f172a;
    classDef note fill:#f6f7f9,stroke:#9ca3af,stroke-width:1px,color:#111827;
    class G1,G2,G3,G4 guide;
    class A_DESC note;
